    {
      "challengedBy": [],
      "claim": "The handler resolves the app via prisma.app.findUnique({ where: { slug: reqBody.appSlug } }) but later stores credential.appId as appMetadata.slug from appStoreMetadata rather than the app row that was just found. If those identifiers differ, the webhook will create/update credentials under a different appId than the one it validated, so later reads scoped by the database app record can miss the credential.",
